VALUES ('8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb', '78ct Collector Grade Lagoon Tourmaline Cabochon | Vivid Neon Blue Green Gemstone | Afghanistan Collector Piece', 'MUSEUM-SIZE 78.00 CARAT NEON LAGOON TOURMALINE CABOCHON - AFGHANISTAN

A true collector''s treasure. This is not a commercial parcel cabochon. This is a single, massive 78-carat natural Lagoon Tourmaline from the legendary mines of Kunar, Afghanistan - a size rarely seen in this vivid neon blue-green hue.
Why This Stone Is Exceptional:
Color: Intense vivid lagoon - that perfect balance of electric blue and lush green that glows like the tropical sea. In daylight it shows a pure, saturated neon with no brown or grey masking. This is the top Paraiba-like color that made Afghan lagoon famous worldwide.
Size & Presence: At 78.00 carats and over 30mm, this is a museum statement piece. Most lagoon tourmalines on the market are 1-5 carats. A clean, translucent piece of this magnitude is a once-in-a-parcel find. Perfect for a bold men''s ring, luxury pendant, or high-end collector display.
Clarity & Glow: Translucent with a captivating inner glow. Like all large natural tourmalines, it carries its natural silk and fingerprint character inside - visible in the photos - proof of its natural, untreated origin. Polished to a high glass dome with excellent luster that reflects light like emerald.
Origin: 100% Natural, No Heat, No Treatment. Mined in Kunar Province, Afghanistan. The world''s most prized source for Lagoon Tourmaline.
Details:
•  Weight: 78.00 Carats
•  Cut: High-Dome Oval Cabochon
•  Color: Vivid Neon Lagoon Blue-Green
•  Clarity: Transparent , Slightly Included
•  Origin: Kunar, Afghanistan
•  Treatment: None - 100% Natural
•  Size:  25x23x14.3 mm', '8e62de6b-7821-4b0e-be9e-fd9259e99a68', 4299, 1, 'loose_stone', 'Tourmaline', NULL, 78, 'ct', 'Afghanistan', 'Transparent , Slightly Included', '25x23x14.3', '["https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-1.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-2.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-3.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-4.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-5.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-6.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-7.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-8.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-9.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/8e8fab37-fd08-4dc5-bf82-a1de4aaaffdb/etsy-10.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Imported from Etsy (2026-11-08). Etsy price 4800 USD, converted at ECB rate. Etsy tags: neon blue tourmaline,lagoon tourmaline,paraiba tourmaline,Afghan tourmaline,natural tourmaline,tourmaline cabochon,collector gemstone,statement gemstone,green cabochon,78 carat caboshon,vivid lagoon,big tourmaline,big tourmaline cab.', 'both', 25, 4, 8, 3, 'available', false)
