VALUES ('4e12d376-e6a0-4770-a2fd-80bcb7da36f5', '7.5 CT’s vibrant Ceylon yellow sapphire lot, untreated', 'Add a touch of elegance with this genuine yellow sapphire gemstone. Featuring natural inclusions, this  stone is perfect for collectors, jewelry making, or as a unique gift. Its vibrant yellow hue radiates warmth and charm, making it an excellent choice for custom rings, pendants, or other bespoke designs.

Features:
	•	Type: Natural Yellow Sapphire
	•	Carat Weight: 26 
	•	Clarity: Visible inclusions, adding unique character
