VALUES ('5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a', 'Natural Nigerian Emerald 1.5 CT, Eye Clean Untreated No Oil, Loose Faceted Green Gemstone for Ring, May Birthstone, Fine Jewelry Stone', 'Natural Nigerian Emerald — 1.5 CT, Eye Clean, No Oil, Untreated A vivid green faceted emerald from the emerald mines of Nigeria, hand-selected for its rare clarity and saturated color. Completely untreated and never oiled — exactly as nature made it.
 ✦ Weight: 1.5 carats 
✦ Dimensions: 6.6 × 6.1 × 5.2 mm
 ✦ Origin: Nigeria (ethically sourced)
 ✦ Clarity: Eye clean 
✦ Treatment: None — no oil, no heat, 100% natural 
✦ Cut: Faceted Perfect for: custom engagement rings, May birthstone jewelry, fine pendants, or serious collectors of untreated gemstones. Why untreated matters: Over 99% of emeralds on the market are oil-treated to hide fractures. This one isn''t — you''re getting the stone in its true, natural state, which is dramatically rarer and holds value far better. 
📦 Ships within 1–2 business days in a padded gem jar, fully insured and tracked.
 💬 Questions? Message me — I''m happy to send additional photos or video of the stone in natural light.
 ⭐ Thank you for supporting a small gemstone business. Every stone is personally inspected before shipping.', '8e62de6b-7821-4b0e-be9e-fd9259e99a68', 582, 1, 'jewelry', 'Emerald', NULL, 1.5, 'ct', 'Nigeria', 'Eye clean', NULL, '["https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-1.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-2.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-3.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-4.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-5.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/5bd2edfd-5d57-4874-aa9c-e5839069151a/etsy-6.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Imported from Etsy (2026-11-08). Etsy price 650 USD, converted at ECB rate. Etsy tags: loose emerald,emeralds,natural emerald,emerald gemstone,faceted emerald,genuine emerald,precious stones,Nigerian emerald,untreated emerald,may birthstone,green emerald,emerald for ring,jewelry making stone.', 'both', 25, 4, 8, 3, 'available', false)
