VALUES ('bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4', 'Blue Lagoon Tourmaline – 57 Carats, Afghan Cushion Cut Gemstone – Teal Blue Green Collector Piece', 'A bold and captivating 57 carat Blue Lagoon Tourmaline sourced from Afghanistan, showcasing a rich teal-blue body color with subtle green undertones. This gemstone displays the sought-after “lagoon” hue, a perfect balance between oceanic blue and tropical green, making it highly desirable among collectors and designers.

Expertly fashioned in a cushion cut, the stone offers a broad face-up appearance with excellent presence. Its large size and luminous color make it ideal as a statement centerpiece for high-end jewelry or as part of a serious gemstone collection.

Key Features:

* Weight: 57 Carats
* Gemstone: Natural Tourmaline
* Color: Blue Lagoon (Teal Blue-Green)
* Origin: Afghanistan
* Cut: Cushion
* Transparency: Semi-transparent 
* Treatment: (No  treatments)

This stone carries natural inclusions typical of tourmaline, which add character and confirm its authenticity. Under light, it reveals depth and a soft internal glow, enhancing its ocean-like appearance.

Perfect for:

* Statement rings or pendants
* High-end custom jewelry
* Gemstone collectors
* Investment-grade pieces

A rare opportunity to own a large, eye-catching Afghan tourmaline with exceptional color presence.', '8e62de6b-7821-4b0e-be9e-fd9259e99a68', 4299, 1, 'loose_stone', 'Tourmaline', NULL, 57, 'ct', 'Afghanistan', NULL, NULL, '["https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-1.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-2.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-3.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-4.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-5.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-6.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-7.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-8.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-9.jpg","https://media.gemworkers.com/items/bf79db1d-a79f-42c2-af69-c29b1296f4e4/etsy-10.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Imported from Etsy (2026-11-08). Etsy price 4800 USD, converted at ECB rate. Etsy tags: bluegreen tourmaline,lagoon tourmaline,natural tourmaline,afghan tourmaline,faceted tourmaline,loose gemstone,blue tourmaline,loose tourmaline,cushion cut tourmali,statement gemstone,tourmaline for ring,natural gemstone,investment gemstone.', 'both', 25, 4, 8, 3, 'available', false)
