VALUES ('16565462-5e44-45b1-a136-73f2f79f8fdd', '91 CT Pink Morganite Gemstone: Cushion Cut Loose Stone', 'This breathtaking 91 -carat pink morganite is a true collector’s piece! Featuring  and a beautifully proportioned cushion cut, this gem exhibits a mesmerizing mix of delicate blush and champagne hues. Its excellent faceting enhances brilliance, making it a perfect centerpiece for high-end jewelry, engagement rings, or statement pendants.

Specifications:
	•	Gemstone: Natural Morganite
	•	Weight: 91 CT
	•	Cut: Cushion
	•	Clarity:  Natural inclusion 
	•	Color: Soft Pink with Champagne Tones
