VALUES ('fb3ef96c-0c6f-4f81-be10-c4d993d10538', 'rubilite tourmaline necklace in sliver', 'Add timeless elegance to your jewelry collection with this stunning 5.4 carat Rubellite Tourmaline pendant.
Beautifully crafted in solid sterling silver, this pear-shaped deep pink to red Rubellite Tourmaline is surrounded by a dazzling halo of sparkling white zircon stones — giving the appearance of high-end diamonds at a fraction of the cost.

Whether worn as a daily luxury or reserved for special occasions, this handcrafted piece offers sophistication and natural beauty in one radiant pendant.

⸻

Details:
	•	Main Stone: Natural Rubellite Tourmaline
	•	Cut: Pear/Heart Style
	•	Weight: 5.4 Carats
	•	Accent Stones: High-quality White Zircon
	•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver
	•	Chain: Included – Durable and elegant silver chain
	•	Pendant Size: Approx. 20mm x 17mm
	•	Handmade: Yes
	•	Gift-Ready Packaging: Included

⸻

Why You’ll Love It:
✔ Genuine Rubellite – known for its vibrant raspberry-red glow
✔ A perfect birthstone gift for July
✔ Elegant and affordable alternative to ruby and diamond necklaces
✔ Makes a meaningful gift for anniversaries, birthdays, or yourself

